WEBVTT

NOTE Generated from the selected five-scene voice cut; normalized AI, StatePort, and alpha.3 tokens.

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.920
AI chats forget.

2
00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:03.040
Your work shouldn't.

3
00:00:03.170 --> 00:00:04.390
StatePort gives AI

4
00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:05.660
assisted work a durable

5
00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:07.680
home on your own machine.

6
00:00:07.855 --> 00:00:10.405
A real app retains its context.

7
00:00:10.495 --> 00:00:12.085
The study plan, the progress,

8
00:00:12.085 --> 00:00:14.565
the evidence, not a blank chat box.

9
00:00:14.643 --> 00:00:16.633
Consequential changes are reviewed

10
00:00:16.713 --> 00:00:18.213
before they land,

11
00:00:18.213 --> 00:00:19.523
and they stay undoable.

12
00:00:19.769 --> 00:00:21.709
And every run leaves a receipt,

13
00:00:21.939 --> 00:00:22.789
what was asked,

14
00:00:22.839 --> 00:00:24.309
what was allowed, what was done.

15
00:00:24.518 --> 00:00:26.068
StatePort alpha.3

16
00:00:26.308 --> 00:00:28.248
is published for inspection.

17
00:00:28.318 --> 00:00:31.088
Installation is disabled while we fix it.

18
00:00:31.158 --> 00:00:33.067
See exactly where things stand.
